        <mxCell id="legend" value="MIN–MAX NOTATION&lt;br/&gt;Rectangle = entity; diamond = relationship; oval = attribute; underline = candidate key.&lt;br/&gt;Each label describes the participation of the entity on that line: (0,N) optional many; (0,1) optional one; (1,1) exactly one / total participation.&lt;br/&gt;Foreign keys are introduced during relational mapping, not repeated as conceptual ER attributes.&lt;br/&gt;RECEIVES: USER is the STAFF assignee. CREATES: USER is the assigning ADMIN. RECORDS: USER is the status-change actor.&lt;br/&gt;A COMPLAINT has at most one FEEDBACK and one COMPLAINT_EMBEDDING. These entities retain feedback_id and embedding_id as independent keys.&lt;br/&gt;The structural model allows no status log initially; application submission transactions must create the initial STATUS_HISTORY record.&lt;br/&gt;The embedding is one vector-valued attribute, not a multivalued ER attribute." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#222222;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;fontSize=19;fillColor=#f5f5f5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="100" y="2630" width="4080" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
